✨ Some leaders make history. Others return to sign it in gold. ✨

As Rotaract Jabali celebrates the birth of a new chapter, it is only fitting that our charter is officiated by a man who has already written chapters across clubs, districts and the African continent.

We are honoured to be chartered by Rtn. PDRR Kennedy Gayah — Past Rotaract Africa President, Past President Rotary Jabali, and PDRR  D9212— a leader whose journey comes full circle on this historic day. 🌍

A true Jabali at heart, returning not just as an officiator, but as proof that leadership rooted in service always finds its way back.

As we step into our elegant black-and-gold era at the Rotaract Jabali Charter Party, we are privileged to have one who understands both where we’ve been and where we’re going.

📍 Swiss Lenana Mount Hotel
🕑 2:00 PM prompt
🗓 31st January 2026

