Our guest speaker this week is  Hon. Soipan Tuya , Cabinet Secretary for Defence of the Republic of Kenya. 

A distinguished lawyer and Advocate of the High Court, she holds an LLB from the University of Nairobi and an LLM in Sustainable International Development from the University of Washington.

She currently serves as the principal advisor to the President on defence matters and chairs the Defence Council.

As the former Cabinet Secretary for Environment, she launched the 15 Billion National Tree Growing Programme to reach 30% tree cover by 2032.

Additionally, she successfully co-hosted the inaugural Africa Climate Summit in 2023, leading to the Nairobi Declaration.

She served as a two-term MP for Narok County and she has dedicated 18 years to legal advocacy and free representation for vulnerable women and children in pastoralist communities.

Hon. Tuya’s career is defined by her commitment to national security, environmental sustainability, and the economic empowerment of all Kenyans.', 'rotarycluboflangata', '["photo_130@11-02-2026_11-03-22.jpg","photo_131@11-02-2026_13-15-50.jpg","photo_132@11-02-2026_18-25-09.jpg","photo_133@11-02-2026_19-47-29.jpg","photo_134@11-02-2026_19-47-30.jpg","photo_135@11-02-2026_19-47-30.jpg","photo_136@11-02-2026_19-47-30.jpg","photo_137@11-02-2026_20-23-31.jpg","photo_138@11-02-2026_20-53-40.jpg","photo_139@11-02-2026_20-53-41.jpg","photo_140@11-02-2026_20-53-41.jpg","photo_141@11-02-2026_20-53-42.jpg","photo_142@11-02-2026_20-53-43.jpg","photo_143@11-02-2026_20-53-46.jpg","photo_144@11-02-2026_20-53-48.jpg","photo_145@11-02-2026_20-53-48.jpg","photo_146@11-02-2026_20-53-49.jpg","photo_147@11-02-2026_20-53-52.jpg","photo_148@11-02-2026_20-53-53.jpg","photo_149@11-02-2026_21-27-16.jpg","photo_150@11-02-2026_21-27-16.jpg","photo_151@11-02-2026_21-27-17.jpg","photo_152@11-02-2026_21-27-17.jpg","photo_153@11-02-2026_21-27-18.jpg","photo_154@11-02-2026_21-27-21.jpg","photo_155@11-02-2026_21-27-22.jpg","photo_156@11-02-2026_21-27-22.jpg","photo_157@11-02-2026_21-27-23.jpg","photo_158@11-02-2026_21-27-23.jpg","photo_159@11-02-2026_21-27-27.jpg","photo_160@11-02-2026_21-27-27.jpg","photo_161@11-02-2026_22-09-56.jpg"]', '[]');

