121 Years of Service. One Shared Pulse. 💓

On this day in 1905, Paul Harris and three friends met in Room 711 in Chicago, sparking a movement that would change the world. Today, as we celebrate Rotary’s 121st Birthday, we honor that legacy of "Service Above Self."

From eradicating Polio to building peace in our local communities, the heartbeat of Rotary is stronger than ever. At the Rotary Club of Nairobi East, we are proud to be part of this global tapestry of 1.4 million change-makers.

Happy Birthday, Rotary International! 🎂📽️', 'rcnairobieast', '["photo_309@23-02-2026_12-12-08.jpg","photo_310@23-02-2026_13-08-12.jpg","photo_311@23-02-2026_16-17-25.jpg"]', '[]');

