For over a century, the Rotary Foundation has been the heartbeat of Rotary, turning generosity into clean water, quality education, disease prevention, peacebuilding, maternal and  child health, community development and economic empowerment & supporting the Environment across the world. It is through the Foundation that our contributions become global impact.

Every dollar given is not just a donation, it is hope extended, a life changed, a future protected.

We are deeply honored and grateful to be among the Top 5 Giving Clubs in District 9212 over the last 13 years. This recognition is not about numbers, it is about commitment, consistency & belief in something bigger than ourselves.

It speaks to members who choose Service Above Self.
It reflects a club that understands that real change requires investment.
It affirms that when we give through The Rotary Foundation, we multiply impact beyond borders.

We celebrate this milestone with humility and renewed purpose. 

Because giving is not an obligation,it is a responsibility to our shared future.

🥂 to continuing to serve, to give, and to transform lives. 

#PeopleOfAction | #ServiceAboveSelf | #TheRotaryFoundation', 'rcnairobisouth', '["photo_330@27-02-2026_08-31-06.jpg","photo_331@27-02-2026_13-47-46.jpg","photo_332@27-02-2026_18-31-05.jpg"]', '["#peopleofaction","#serviceaboveself","#therotaryfoundation"]');

