🎉 Big News, Rotarians! We’re Growing the Family! 🎉

Get ready to welcome THREE incredible new members to our club this coming week! We are thrilled to announce the induction of a dynamic trio who bring a powerhouse of skills to our mission of Service Above Self.

🚀 Please join us in welcoming:
🔹 A Real Estate Developer – Ready to help us build and shape our communities.
🔹 A Tech Innovator – Bringing fresh ideas and digital solutions to our projects.
🔹 A Mechanical Engineer – Adding precision and technical expertise to our service.

Their diverse talents will be instrumental in driving our impact forward!

Join us for a prestigious High Tea Induction Ceremony to make them officially part of the Rotary family.

Event Details:
📅 Date: Thursday, 5th March 2026
⏰ Time: 6:30 PM – 8:00 PM
📍 Venue: Trademark Hotel, Gigiri

We are honored to have:
🎤 Guest Speaker: PDG Alex Nyaga
⚖️ Inducting Officer: AG Rahab Mwathi

Let’s show our newest members the true meaning of Rotary spirit! Bring a guest and let’s pack the house. See you there! 👏

