Today we celebrate the strength, resilience and impact of women everywhere as we mark International Women’s Day.

At the Rotary Club of Nairobi East, we honor the incredible women in our club, our communities and around the world who continue to lead, serve and inspire change. From championing education and health to advancing clean water, sanitation and community development, women play a vital role in shaping a better future for all.

This year’s celebration is also a reminder that empowering women and girls strengthens families, communities and nations. When women rise, communities thrive.

To the remarkable women of Rotary, Rotaract and our wider community — thank you for your leadership, compassion and dedication to service above self.

