People of Action,

I am pleased to present to you the President Elect for Rotary Year 2025/2026, *Rtn Njeri Burugu.*

Rtn Njeri is currently serving as the *Club Administration Director* a role she has executed with great effectiveness and continues to serve with dedication.

 Previously, she has served as Membership Director and Service Projects Director and has also held various leadership positions at the District level.

She is currently the Project Manager of the Elimika Grant, a transformative initiative aimed at addressing digital literacy gaps in schools.

Kindly join me in congratulating Rtn Njeri on her election and let us accord her the full support she needs as she prepares to serve our club in this important leadership role.👏🏽👏🏽👏🏽
