This Tuesday, 17th March 2026 we host the Redistricting Town Hall, featuring the Redistricting CEO, PP Wahome Gichu.

Did you know that in the next three months, District 9212 will be split into two, forming District 9215 and District 9216?

This transition brings exciting possibilities and we will be hearing first-hand from the champion of the process. If you have questions, thoughts, or even concerns, this will be the perfect opportunity to gain clarity and understand the gains that lie ahead.

*📍 Location: The Luke Hotel – Roasters Inn
*🕡 Time: 6:30 PM
*🗓️Date: Tuesday, 17th March 2026

